  id: CubicWires
  title: Cubic Wires
  author: BCMGF1137
  description: "One of my most complicated 3D modeling undertakings. Enjoy. Or don't,
    I guess.\r\n\r\n//\r\n\r\nCut all 12 wires from a rotating cube depending on how
    the cube rotates as well as relations between pairs of wires.\r\n\r\n//\r\n\r\nI
    had this as a mod idea since like... I think 2024?? I had a relatively simple
    solving process with it, but changed it to take advantage of the module being
    a cube.\r\nI kinda had fun with making the wires until I eventually had to learn
    how to fix the \"normals\" on each of the wires... goshdarnit I have never spent
    SO MUCH effort on a KTANE module like this\r\n\r\nThis module comes with TP support
    as usual. One of the solve messages should tell you enough.\r\n\r\n//\r\n\r\nSong:
    \"Hypercubes\" by Ryzmik // https://www.newgrounds.com/audio/listen/1033872"
  version: 0.0.0
  outputFolder: build
  debugBuild: 1
  previewImage: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 1e301038068c02540bfee23f565bc54f, type: 3}
